    "notes": "WBTC confirms AC-24 Patuli → Howrah and the ordered corridor Ruby → Gariahat → Hazra → Exide → Park Street → Esplanade. Three user-provided route map images identify and cross out three incorrect router detours—the Patuli access kink, the Kasba/Gariahat zig-zag, and the central one-way loops—and confirm the broad southern corridor. Their pixels were not copied as coordinates. The corrected central guide follows the supplied alignment west from Ruby along the Rash Behari corridor to Hazra, then north past Exide and Park Street. OSM routing supplies the remaining outer sections. Geometry and kerbside points remain approximate until a full GPS/GPX trace or additional close-up references are reviewed."
